== ADR-0011: a choice has the selector type. A Const keeps its inferred type
== (`Const K := 5` is Integer); only a literal-only expression is read in the
== selector type and range-checked.
Module Diagnostics.CaseTypedConstMismatch

Const K := 5

Main :
    V UInt8 := UInt8(5)
    case V
        K PutLn(1)
        otherwise
    ;
;
